WEBVTT

01:49.109 --> 01:56.116
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

02:02.872 --> 02:03.706
Ordinary life…

02:05.875 --> 02:08.128
was all I ever dreamed of.

02:10.630 --> 02:13.216
Gathering with my family for dinner

02:14.884 --> 02:16.886
and sharing the day's stories.

02:20.390 --> 02:21.808
Dreaming of the future

02:23.351 --> 02:24.769
with the person I love.

02:25.937 --> 02:27.021
Just like that.

02:37.448 --> 02:38.825
I just wanted to live…

02:41.327 --> 02:42.787
the ordinary life…

02:44.956 --> 02:46.249
that everyone else has.

02:59.137 --> 03:01.306
What a futile dream you had.

03:07.645 --> 03:11.357
In this world you live in,
the more you dream of such things,

03:12.025 --> 03:13.776
the more painful life becomes.

03:16.863 --> 03:18.198
Why are you keeping me here?

03:20.366 --> 03:25.163
I was curious
as to what kind of person you were.

03:28.166 --> 03:29.667
Seeing you like this,

03:30.710 --> 03:33.296
I can tell you have Seishin's eyes.

03:35.798 --> 03:36.966
Do you know my mother?

03:38.885 --> 03:41.054
There's a time in life when we realize

03:42.055 --> 03:45.225
that we are linked together
by chains of fate far more powerful

03:45.975 --> 03:47.602
and mysterious than we'd expect.

03:49.896 --> 03:54.442
For you, Ms. Yoon Chae-ok, Seishin, and I,

03:56.361 --> 03:57.862
it seems that is the case.

04:02.242 --> 04:04.744
He says he knows
where Yoon Chae-ok was taken.

04:06.371 --> 04:07.455
Excuse me.

04:07.538 --> 04:10.124
Do you really believe
what that kid is saying?

04:10.208 --> 04:11.459
Can we believe him?

04:11.542 --> 04:12.794
I'm sure of it.

04:13.711 --> 04:15.964
I just saw her with my own eyes.

04:16.047 --> 04:18.424
You bit the hand that fed you!

04:18.508 --> 04:21.219
How could you do this
to Master Jang, you ingrate?

04:21.302 --> 04:23.429
He's already heard those words from me.

04:23.513 --> 04:25.765
When you were starving to death,

04:25.848 --> 04:28.393
who took you in and made you
into a decent human being?

04:28.476 --> 04:30.144
I already said that too.

04:30.228 --> 04:32.897
I was told that Master Jang
wouldn't be harmed

04:32.981 --> 04:35.650
and that he would be safe
if I reported the woman.

04:35.733 --> 04:39.153
Lady Maeda said
this was all for Master Jang's sake.

04:40.280 --> 04:44.701
My goodness, you thickheaded buffoon.
You actually believed that?

04:56.337 --> 04:59.215
Where is it?
Where is Yoon Chae-ok being held?

05:06.931 --> 05:08.099
Is the prey ready?

05:08.182 --> 05:10.685
Lady Maeda sent us a Josenjing woman.

06:00.568 --> 06:01.694
What are you doing?

06:01.778 --> 06:03.112
Hold onto it for me.

06:04.197 --> 06:05.531
If I don't make it back…

06:05.615 --> 06:06.741
Master Jang.

06:09.535 --> 06:10.870
…then sell this shop.

06:13.873 --> 06:15.041
Please, Mrs. Nawol.

06:18.961 --> 06:21.089
The short wicks go off after five minutes,

06:21.964 --> 06:24.092
and the long ones after eight minutes.

06:24.884 --> 06:28.805
Each explosive has a blast radius
of about five to six meters.

06:28.888 --> 06:32.767
It probably won't knock down the building,
but it will deal a serious blow.

06:40.191 --> 06:41.359
Look, Master Jang.

06:41.442 --> 06:42.527
Master?

06:45.029 --> 06:47.281
I wish you success.

06:47.865 --> 06:49.367
Come back safely.

06:59.127 --> 07:00.670
Will you be okay on your own?

07:01.254 --> 07:04.340
I have already been inside once,
so I know my way around.

07:04.424 --> 07:08.052
It's quicker and easier to move alone,
and getting caught is less likely.

07:09.720 --> 07:10.555
Tae-sang--

07:10.638 --> 07:11.806
Stay safe.

07:13.141 --> 07:17.812
When this is all over,
let's have a drink at the Moonlight Bar.

07:20.731 --> 07:21.566
Sounds good.

07:25.111 --> 07:26.028
Let's go.

07:42.128 --> 07:45.965
It seems
that I have underestimated Lady Maeda.

07:46.048 --> 07:50.178
I didn't expect her
to have you brought here so quickly.

07:52.805 --> 07:53.806
In a moment,

07:55.558 --> 07:57.810
your father will be here as well.

07:58.811 --> 08:00.897
It will be an interesting experiment.

08:02.315 --> 08:03.191
I wonder,

08:04.567 --> 08:06.277
between you and your father,

08:07.403 --> 08:12.408
whose head will your mother devour first?

08:42.396 --> 08:43.231
Hey!

08:43.314 --> 08:44.524
Stop!

09:10.174 --> 09:11.133
How is it…

09:11.759 --> 09:12.927
How is it that

09:15.179 --> 09:16.847
you people never get scared?

09:18.182 --> 09:20.184
You know you can't win.

09:21.185 --> 09:25.356
So, how can you still look at me
with those eyes?

09:26.357 --> 09:28.192
I have a question for you too.

09:31.237 --> 09:33.906
How are you all so unabashedly proud?

09:36.534 --> 09:38.786
You violated my mother.

09:41.247 --> 09:43.833
You trampled on my family's happiness.

09:46.002 --> 09:49.422
Even after killing
so many innocent people…

09:52.842 --> 09:55.928
how can you be so shameless?

10:02.643 --> 10:05.396
My glorious results and achievements

10:06.564 --> 10:10.985
are too great for the likes of you
to dare discuss, Josenjing.

10:18.117 --> 10:19.535
Achievements?

10:23.164 --> 10:24.081
Is that right?

10:26.042 --> 10:28.836
Do you think justifying
and glorifying what you do…

10:31.464 --> 10:34.300
will really erase your crimes?

10:36.093 --> 10:38.095
You can pretend all you want,

10:38.179 --> 10:43.225
but do you think you can hide
your people's inferiority complex?

10:55.946 --> 10:57.073
Colonel Kato?

11:01.786 --> 11:02.703
Colonel Kato!

11:03.663 --> 11:04.497
What?!

11:50.960 --> 11:51.877
Mother…

12:12.356 --> 12:13.190
That's right.

12:14.817 --> 12:15.735
Don't move!

12:16.318 --> 12:19.780
Or your daughter will get hurt, Seishin.

12:34.462 --> 12:35.504
Fire.

12:36.005 --> 12:37.339
Fire!

12:41.135 --> 12:42.887
No, stop!

12:42.970 --> 12:44.138
No!

13:06.744 --> 13:10.080
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN THE END AND ANOTHER BEGINNING

13:10.164 --> 13:12.750
EPISODE 10

13:17.463 --> 13:19.507
You're returning to Tokyo next month?

13:22.468 --> 13:23.886
I'm so jealous.

13:25.221 --> 13:28.474
So, will your anatomy book
be published in Tokyo?

13:30.392 --> 13:31.477
Probably.

13:32.853 --> 13:34.355
Will you become famous, then?

13:39.401 --> 13:40.820
She's beautiful.

13:40.903 --> 13:43.823
Who is she? Your Joseon-born lover?

13:44.365 --> 13:47.201
It's Seishin. Don't you remember?

13:48.244 --> 13:50.412
Wait, that Seishin?

13:52.957 --> 13:55.042
She had such a pretty face.

13:55.125 --> 13:57.461
No wonder her husband
couldn't forget about her.

14:00.297 --> 14:01.298
Husband?

14:01.382 --> 14:04.134
Yes. Haven't you heard?

14:05.094 --> 14:08.639
Apparently, Seishin's husband
came looking for her.

14:08.722 --> 14:10.432
He requested to meet his wife.

14:37.793 --> 14:41.213
MILITARY USE
GASOLINE

15:07.072 --> 15:07.907
Master Jang!

15:08.824 --> 15:09.658
Mr. Yoon?

15:15.998 --> 15:19.084
Bring all the nitrogen gas we have!
Release it all.

15:19.168 --> 15:21.420
Don't let the creature
come up to Level Two!

15:21.503 --> 15:22.546
Yes, sir!

15:26.258 --> 15:27.092
Wait!

15:35.267 --> 15:37.102
It's here. Stop it!

15:38.145 --> 15:39.313
You five!

15:40.773 --> 15:42.399
Grab her and follow me.

15:49.031 --> 15:50.699
So, my daughter

15:52.493 --> 15:54.870
has been captured
and brought back in here?

16:03.295 --> 16:04.254
I'm sorry.

16:05.297 --> 16:07.174
I should've taken better care of her.

16:15.808 --> 16:16.850
Here.

16:19.228 --> 16:22.356
A ship bound for Shanghai will be leaving
from Incheon in the morning.

16:23.190 --> 16:26.402
Chae-ok is currently wanted
for shooting Director Ichiro.

16:26.485 --> 16:29.113
You must get on that ship
right after you escape.

16:31.198 --> 16:32.116
Master Jang…

16:32.199 --> 16:35.202
Leave the rest to me
and take Chae-ok with you.

16:35.786 --> 16:38.080
That way, she'll agree to get on the ship.

17:14.783 --> 17:15.617
No!

17:16.368 --> 17:17.911
Shut the door quickly!

17:17.995 --> 17:19.121
Move! Now!

17:19.204 --> 17:20.205
Mother!

17:34.219 --> 17:35.137
Hurry!

17:43.103 --> 17:46.565
The specimen is currently
blocked off at Level 2-2.

17:47.149 --> 17:48.067
And Colonel Kato?

17:48.150 --> 17:51.111
Coming up the eastern emergency exit
with the Josenjing hostage.

17:51.195 --> 17:53.405
Stop the specimen
at Level Two by all means.

17:54.031 --> 17:56.700
It must not come up any further.
Understood?

17:56.784 --> 17:57.618
Yes, sir!

17:59.161 --> 18:00.329
Damn it.

18:08.128 --> 18:10.214
Did you hear that? That was about Chae-ok.

18:10.714 --> 18:13.217
The eastern emergency exit
is near the central elevator.

18:13.300 --> 18:16.053
It's not far from here.
Let's head that way first.

18:18.597 --> 18:19.932
What are you doing?

18:21.517 --> 18:22.976
I'll take care of the rest.

18:24.228 --> 18:26.855
Please take Chae-ok out with you.

18:28.065 --> 18:29.566
No, this is my duty.

18:30.859 --> 18:32.194
- Master Jang.
- Listen.

18:32.778 --> 18:35.781
I have never once dumped
my responsibilities on someone else.

18:35.864 --> 18:39.535
Moreover, this isn't something
I can leave in someone else's hands.

18:39.618 --> 18:42.121
For Chae-ok's sake, I can't do that.
Don't you get it?

18:42.204 --> 18:43.705
For Chae-ok's sake,

18:45.457 --> 18:47.709
it's only right that you go to her.

18:49.002 --> 18:49.878
Don't you get it?

18:54.091 --> 18:55.050
Master Jang.

18:57.344 --> 18:59.513
I'm someone who lives in the past.

19:01.181 --> 19:05.477
But you and Chae-ok,
you two will live for the future.

19:07.563 --> 19:10.566
Besides, it's my wife who is down there.

19:13.360 --> 19:14.945
How could I let someone else

19:16.155 --> 19:18.532
see to the last moments of my beloved?

19:27.499 --> 19:28.834
Please take…

19:31.920 --> 19:33.422
good care of Chae-ok.

19:38.844 --> 19:40.095
Please be safe.

19:47.352 --> 19:48.312
Colonel Kato!

19:49.354 --> 19:50.272
How's the situation?

19:50.355 --> 19:52.900
We're forming a defense line
to stop it from ascending,

19:52.983 --> 19:56.403
but it would be best to shut down
the underground laboratory, just in case.

19:58.655 --> 20:00.991
I must retrieve
some things from my office.

20:01.074 --> 20:02.075
In ten minutes,

20:03.493 --> 20:05.162
we're shutting this place down.

20:07.706 --> 20:09.666
- Take the girl up with you.
- Yes, sir.

20:14.796 --> 20:15.923
Damn it!

20:17.883 --> 20:19.384
MILITARY USE
GASOLINE

20:57.547 --> 20:58.632
Stay still,

20:58.715 --> 21:00.384
or we will shoot you!

22:10.829 --> 22:12.497
No!

22:24.509 --> 22:25.594
Help me…

22:27.512 --> 22:28.597
My stomach

22:29.848 --> 22:31.683
hurts so much.

22:33.477 --> 22:35.228
Please help me.

22:37.481 --> 22:38.690
My stomach,

22:40.067 --> 22:41.902
it hurts so much…

22:43.153 --> 22:45.280
Save me…

22:46.698 --> 22:48.241
Help me…

22:50.535 --> 22:53.705
My stomach, it hurts so much…

23:28.073 --> 23:28.990
This way.

23:37.666 --> 23:42.337
I have heard no news

23:42.421 --> 23:45.507
Of the boat that left

23:46.758 --> 23:51.430
On the day of Chilseok

23:52.681 --> 23:54.599
Over there

23:57.519 --> 24:00.188
Across the sea

24:02.524 --> 24:05.152
The boat returns

24:09.614 --> 24:16.288
And the song of the boatsman

24:18.039 --> 24:22.711
Draws nearer and nearer

24:26.798 --> 24:30.635
But you, my love

24:30.719 --> 24:34.931
I've not heard from you

24:35.640 --> 24:40.520
Ever since you left

25:19.935 --> 25:20.769
Honey.

25:23.772 --> 25:24.981
Seong-sim!

25:34.449 --> 25:35.575
It's time…

25:37.911 --> 25:40.038
for us to leave here together.

26:51.776 --> 26:52.694
Let's go.

26:58.325 --> 27:00.535
The way out is this way, not that way.

27:01.119 --> 27:03.663
My father and mother are still down there.

27:09.002 --> 27:10.420
It was his last request!

27:13.381 --> 27:15.925
I promised to get you out of here safely.

27:18.303 --> 27:21.890
I made that promise to your father.

27:25.310 --> 27:27.479
You met my father?

27:28.897 --> 27:29.898
He said

27:31.775 --> 27:33.443
he wanted to be with your mother.

29:25.388 --> 29:29.058
There was a large explosion
at Ongseong Hospital just now.

29:35.398 --> 29:38.485
Hey! I heard there was a loud explosion
over at Ongseong Hospital!

29:39.068 --> 29:40.820
Loud enough to shake the buildings!

29:40.904 --> 29:44.073
It's caused a hell of a ruckus.
The fire brigade is on its way!

29:44.157 --> 29:45.074
Let's go!

30:15.855 --> 30:17.690
- Put 'em out!
- Hurry!

30:18.983 --> 30:19.859
Put the fire out!

30:20.527 --> 30:21.945
Before it spreads all over!

30:22.445 --> 30:24.614
Water! Bring more water!

30:25.198 --> 30:27.116
- Bring more!
- Put it out now!

30:34.332 --> 30:36.626
The specimen is nowhere to be seen, sir.

30:36.709 --> 30:38.753
It wasn't found in Area One either.

30:39.295 --> 30:42.590
Any chance it perished in the fire
or was crushed under the rubble?

30:42.674 --> 30:45.510
Then there should be traces of it,
but there's nothing.

30:45.593 --> 30:47.929
What? Where could it have gone?

31:45.445 --> 31:48.364
The entrance to the yard is open,
thanks to the firefighters.

31:49.157 --> 31:52.827
You'll be able to make your escape
amid the chaos.

31:55.538 --> 31:57.957
We'll go on our own from here.

31:59.167 --> 32:00.001
But--

32:00.084 --> 32:03.463
You helped us escape the ward,
and we're more than grateful.

32:05.006 --> 32:06.925
But I can't let you risk your life.

32:13.556 --> 32:15.683
I sincerely apologize.

32:18.436 --> 32:23.858
For the things that happened to you
and your mother…

32:26.569 --> 32:27.820
I'd like to apologize.

32:29.113 --> 32:32.116
I've been making excuses,
telling myself that

32:33.034 --> 32:35.620
I have no choice given the time I live in.

32:36.788 --> 32:37.747
But the truth is…

32:39.749 --> 32:40.708
I was just…

32:43.628 --> 32:45.129
one of the bystanders.

32:47.632 --> 32:48.549
Please…

32:51.427 --> 32:53.930
take care of yourself, Mr. Sachimoto.

35:47.812 --> 35:48.646
Your papers.

35:48.729 --> 35:50.231
Mr. Wang sent me.

35:51.065 --> 35:52.567
It's a message from Master Jang.

36:27.727 --> 36:31.105
Beom-o, go and bring Mr. Park over.

36:31.189 --> 36:32.648
We need to use his rickshaw.

36:32.732 --> 36:35.902
Mrs. Nawol, I'll do it.
A car is faster than a rickshaw.

36:35.985 --> 36:38.029
And have the whole police bureau
take notice?

36:38.112 --> 36:39.989
They won't. I'll be careful!

36:40.072 --> 36:42.617
Forget it. Safety comes first.

36:43.659 --> 36:46.204
Then I'll deliver it.

36:47.330 --> 36:49.790
Well, a bicycle is faster than a rickshaw.

36:50.541 --> 36:52.877
And the police won't care about me.

36:57.173 --> 36:58.299
Please…

37:00.301 --> 37:02.720
give me one chance to redeem myself.

37:03.471 --> 37:04.305
Please?

37:26.077 --> 37:26.911
Follow him.

37:34.043 --> 37:34.877
Thanks.

37:34.961 --> 37:37.964
Go to Mrs. Nawol in the morning,
and she'll pay you.

37:38.047 --> 37:40.549
Take care, Master Jang.

37:51.644 --> 37:54.438
HEINOUS MURDERER

38:13.958 --> 38:16.961
I arranged our ride to Incheon. Let's go.

38:28.347 --> 38:29.307
Ms. Yoon.

38:32.685 --> 38:34.312
Let's end it here.

38:40.109 --> 38:41.944
I'll go alone from here.

38:43.195 --> 38:44.447
What do you mean?

38:44.530 --> 38:47.033
I'm the one who killed Director Ichiro.

38:48.492 --> 38:50.411
I'm the one they're looking for.

38:50.995 --> 38:54.081
I may have to live
the rest of my life on the run

38:54.165 --> 38:57.376
without knowing
when I'll be captured and killed.

38:57.877 --> 39:00.129
That's why I want you
to get on the ship with me.

39:00.212 --> 39:02.381
I don't wish to drag you…

39:05.551 --> 39:07.845
into my life of worries.

39:20.066 --> 39:21.150
Do you…

39:26.322 --> 39:27.239
not like me?

39:29.700 --> 39:31.327
You know that's not what I mean.

39:33.371 --> 39:34.914
Then it's all settled.

39:37.458 --> 39:39.043
I'm going with you.

39:39.126 --> 39:40.294
Master Jang.

39:41.045 --> 39:41.879
I…

39:45.091 --> 39:47.760
have already died once.

39:50.221 --> 39:52.098
The reason I'm standing here

39:53.307 --> 39:55.643
is because your father granted me

39:57.228 --> 39:58.896
a bonus life, if you will…

40:01.190 --> 40:02.775
to protect you.

40:04.777 --> 40:06.278
To stay by your side.

40:08.572 --> 40:10.950
They won't give up looking for me.

40:11.033 --> 40:13.077
And I will never give you up.

40:17.415 --> 40:19.166
I can't live without you.

40:20.709 --> 40:22.044
You already know that.

41:03.878 --> 41:04.879
No way.

42:55.364 --> 42:59.201
We cannot delay any longer.
Let's get going so we don't miss the ship.

43:08.002 --> 43:08.919
Wait.

43:18.762 --> 43:20.723
- Beom-o, you came.
- Yes.

43:21.557 --> 43:24.977
I'm a bit late because I had to lose
a tail along the way.

44:21.116 --> 44:23.619
Well done, Shiro.

44:25.537 --> 44:26.413
No.

44:26.914 --> 44:29.875
Master, it's not what it looks like.
It really isn't. I swear!

44:29.958 --> 44:31.377
Please believe me!

44:36.298 --> 44:38.967
All right. Hide over there.

44:46.934 --> 44:47.935
In any case,

44:49.186 --> 44:51.188
I have to give it to you, Mr. Jang.

44:52.648 --> 44:56.568
Once you set your eyes on something,
you acquire it by any means necessary.

44:58.112 --> 45:02.700
But burning the hospital to the ground
like that was a bit too much.

45:03.659 --> 45:07.246
Nothing compared to the things
you people did inside those walls.

45:07.913 --> 45:10.499
So, what are you going to do now?

45:12.418 --> 45:17.339
Will you really give everything up
for that seditious Joseon woman?

45:17.923 --> 45:19.633
I believe I gave my answer.

45:32.730 --> 45:38.110
There was a time
when I considered you a friend.

45:39.361 --> 45:42.114
I suppose I'm losing a friend today.

45:46.076 --> 45:49.163
Come to think of it,
I lost another friend of mine

45:49.788 --> 45:52.458
just like this in the past.

45:54.960 --> 45:56.920
At that time…

45:59.673 --> 46:01.592
it was because of that girl's mother.

46:14.521 --> 46:15.355
Now,

46:16.523 --> 46:20.277
I ask you both to die here.

46:24.865 --> 46:25.699
Goodbye.

47:05.239 --> 47:06.114
Kill them!

50:38.618 --> 50:39.536
Let's go.

51:37.803 --> 51:38.637
Hang on.

51:43.600 --> 51:44.476
Get up.

51:54.778 --> 51:55.946
Get up.

52:21.054 --> 52:22.305
Mother…

52:27.269 --> 52:29.020
Stop this now.

52:34.860 --> 52:37.904
I know you're in pain too.

52:50.000 --> 52:51.209
This man…

52:56.423 --> 52:59.593
This is the man I love.

53:03.180 --> 53:04.264
So…

53:06.892 --> 53:07.726
let's…

53:09.769 --> 53:12.439
stop this now.

53:20.488 --> 53:22.324
Let's end it here.

53:32.709 --> 53:33.710
Ms. Yoon.

53:35.337 --> 53:36.171
Ms. Yoon.

53:40.759 --> 53:41.593
Ms. Yoon!

53:42.844 --> 53:45.805
You'll be all right. Hang in there!

53:49.267 --> 53:50.644
We promised to be together.

53:53.063 --> 53:55.482
Try getting up.

53:55.565 --> 53:58.276
Ms. Yoon, please get up.

54:06.826 --> 54:08.662
The cherry blossoms…

54:13.250 --> 54:14.834
have all fallen.

54:48.535 --> 54:49.619
Stay with me.

54:52.872 --> 54:53.790
Stay…

54:56.459 --> 54:57.627
right by my side.

55:09.431 --> 55:10.390
This can't be.

55:11.558 --> 55:12.392
No…

55:15.186 --> 55:16.146
No!

55:16.980 --> 55:18.148
No!

55:23.028 --> 55:24.279
No!

55:30.201 --> 55:31.077
No…

55:40.128 --> 55:41.004
No…

55:50.930 --> 55:53.600
Please, no…

56:51.908 --> 56:52.826
Colonel Kato!

56:53.493 --> 56:54.411
Sir!

57:13.430 --> 57:14.514
Colonel!

57:29.946 --> 57:31.114
Colonel.

57:36.202 --> 57:37.203
Keep it down.

58:05.190 --> 58:06.107
How amazing!

58:38.139 --> 58:41.226
My friend asked me
to give this to you, ma'am.

58:44.812 --> 58:45.813
Your friend?

58:47.106 --> 58:50.026
Jang Tae-sang
of the House of Golden Treasure.

59:19.389 --> 59:21.891
FAREWELL

59:54.632 --> 59:57.218
FROM JANG TAE-SANG
OF HOUSE OF GOLDEN TREASURE

59:58.678 --> 01:00:01.848
FROM AKIKO
COURTESAN OF SPRING MOON HALL

01:00:01.931 --> 01:00:04.434
FROM PRIVATE CHOI YEONG-GWAN
OF DISEASE CONTROL PLATOON

01:00:06.811 --> 01:00:08.146
FROM YOON JUNG-WON
SLEUTH

01:00:08.229 --> 01:00:11.232
FROM YOON CHAE-OK
SLEUTH

01:00:14.861 --> 01:00:17.363
FROM CHOI SEONG-SIM

01:00:35.757 --> 01:00:38.718
FAREWELL

01:01:01.157 --> 01:01:03.743
"Justice prevails. You reap what you sow."

01:01:04.911 --> 01:01:06.371
That's how it goes, you know.

01:01:13.586 --> 01:01:15.088
You've been a big help.

01:01:16.506 --> 01:01:19.342
If you hadn't come that day
and convinced Comrade Lee In-hyeok,

01:01:19.842 --> 01:01:21.594
this rebellion wouldn't have happened.

01:01:22.887 --> 01:01:25.556
Ultimately, you are the true patriot.

01:01:44.033 --> 01:01:45.159
Thanks for the drink.

01:01:45.952 --> 01:01:47.078
I'll see you again.

01:01:48.913 --> 01:01:50.081
Comrade Jang!

01:01:54.752 --> 01:01:56.003
What a huge achievement.

01:01:56.504 --> 01:02:01.592
You really are a true hero and fighter
for our nation. Isn't that right?

01:02:01.676 --> 01:02:03.386
- Hear, hear.
- That's right.

01:02:08.307 --> 01:02:10.685
Are you in urgent need of money?

01:02:11.602 --> 01:02:12.437
Pardon?

01:02:13.020 --> 01:02:15.773
If you have anything useful,
bring it over.

01:02:16.274 --> 01:02:17.859
I'll pay you handsomely.

01:02:22.238 --> 01:02:24.157
By the way, I'm not Comrade Jang.

01:02:24.657 --> 01:02:27.493
I'm Master Jang Tae-sang
of the House of Golden Treasure.

01:02:28.035 --> 01:02:28.870
Well, then.

01:02:40.089 --> 01:02:41.549
Here's the truth, Tae-sang.

01:02:42.049 --> 01:02:44.218
When I was locked up
in the underground lab,

01:02:46.137 --> 01:02:47.388
I gave your name up.

01:02:49.182 --> 01:02:52.518
I ratted out my friend and my comrades

01:02:54.395 --> 01:02:56.022
and begged for my life.

01:03:01.944 --> 01:03:06.365
When this is all over,
let's have a drink at the Moonlight Bar.

01:03:19.295 --> 01:03:21.380
Silk! Come take a look at our silk!

01:03:33.267 --> 01:03:34.393
They are silk!

01:03:39.524 --> 01:03:41.442
Ask them to bring some green onion.

01:03:42.360 --> 01:03:44.403
Yes, please slice some of this meat.

01:03:45.738 --> 01:03:47.740
Hey, excuse me. I'd like one gukbap!

01:04:01.838 --> 01:04:04.131
Let's go inside. The night is cold.

01:04:44.297 --> 01:04:47.967
Spring went past unusually quickly
in Gyeongseong that year.

01:05:53.616 --> 01:05:55.201
And in August of the same year,

01:05:57.119 --> 01:06:01.540
we finally recovered
those that were taken from us.

01:06:08.297 --> 01:06:09.632
As she once said,

01:06:11.300 --> 01:06:12.385
the cherry blossoms

01:06:13.886 --> 01:06:15.429
had already begun to fall.

01:06:39.829 --> 01:06:42.164
Hurray for the independence of Korea!

01:06:42.665 --> 01:06:45.501
Hurray for the independence of Korea!

01:06:46.168 --> 01:06:48.587
Hurray for the independence of Korea!

01:06:48.671 --> 01:06:51.173
Hurray for the independence of Korea!

01:07:04.437 --> 01:07:05.563
Lady Maeda.

01:07:12.361 --> 01:07:15.531
As of today, Ongseong Hospital
is closing its doors.

01:07:20.327 --> 01:07:25.332
Most of the doctors and nurses
will be returning to Japan.

01:07:29.045 --> 01:07:30.629
You must also…

01:07:34.425 --> 01:07:36.635
make a decision now.

01:07:37.553 --> 01:07:38.971
Will you return to Kyoto,

01:07:39.472 --> 01:07:40.306
or

01:07:42.099 --> 01:07:45.603
will you continue
to explore new possibilities?

01:08:43.619 --> 01:08:44.620
As for me,

01:08:45.621 --> 01:08:48.624
I'm still waiting
for the things I have dreamed of.

01:09:20.239 --> 01:09:21.157
Chae-ok.

01:11:02.591 --> 01:11:09.181
IN REMEMBRANCE OF OUR COLLEAGUES
KIM HYEON-JUNG AND SEO JI-HUN

01:11:14.937 --> 01:11:16.397
JUNE 25TH
4:20 A.M.

01:11:20.484 --> 01:11:21.443
SILENT PROTEST

01:11:27.032 --> 01:11:28.242
DREAMS COME TRUE

01:12:00.649 --> 01:12:03.027
Ho-jae, we're ready. Let's go!
